{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "price-structure-compare",
  "displayName": "価格構造の比較",
  "pack": "pricing",
  "category": "structure",
  "description": "料金体系の案を顧客規模ごとの価格／価値の比率で横並びにし、どの案が価値に連動するかと売上・利益への影響を示す",
  "answers": [
    "どの料金体系が顧客規模ごとの価値に最も連動し、売上と利益はどう変わるか"
  ],
  "inferenceLevel": "diagnostic",
  "compatibleLayouts": [
    "BLANK"
  ],
  "defaultDensity": "print",
  "example": "example.json",
  "examples": {
    "print": "example.json",
    "presentation": "example.presentation.json"
  },
  "slots": {
    "title": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": 70
    },
    "lead": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": 100
    },
    "headers": {
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": true,
      "minItems": 3,
      "maxItems": {
        "$density": {
          "print": 5,
          "presentation": 4
        }
      },
      "maxLength": 12
    },
    "rows": {
      "type": "string[][]",
      "required": true,
      "minItems": 3,
      "maxItems": {
        "$density": {
          "print": 6,
          "presentation": 5
        }
      },
      "maxLength": 14
    },
    "impactValue": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": 10
    },
    "impactLabel": {
      "type": "string",
      "default": {
        "$t": "pricing.cm_change"
      },
      "maxLength": 24
    },
    "riskValue": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": 10
    },
    "riskLabel": {
      "type": "string",
      "default": {
        "$t": "pricing.largest_increase"
      },
      "maxLength": 24
    },
    "recommendation": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": {
        "$density": {
          "print": 55,
          "presentation": 30
        }
      }
    },
    "source": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": 170
    }
  },
  "guardrails": [
    "行は顧客規模の帯、列は案。各セルは『価格（価値に対する %）』で書き、同じ規模の価値を分母にそろえる",
    "価格／価値が 100% を超える規模帯は、値引き圧力の発生源になる。どの案でもその帯を確認する",
    "案の比較は同じ顧客分布で行う。分布が仮定なら lead に明記し、出典行に根拠を書く",
    "売上中立（または貢献利益中立）で設計した案は、総額が変わらないことを数字で示し、議論を『誰の価格がどう動くか』に向ける",
    "最大の値上げになる規模帯と移行策（新規から適用、更新時に上限付きで移行）を必ず示す",
    "数値は pricing-strategy スキルの structure_compare.py の出力から転記する"
  ],
  "slide": {
    "layout": "BLANK",
    "figures": [
      {
        "type": "governing_message",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.42,
        "w": 9.0,
        "text": {
          "$slot": "title"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "lead_in",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 1.0,
        "w": 9.0,
        "text": {
          "$slot": "lead"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 1.55,
        "w": 6.3,
        "headers": {
          "$slot": "headers"
        },
        "rows": {
          "$slot": "rows"
        },
        "size": {
          "$density": {
            "print": 9,
            "presentation": 10.5
          }
        },
        "rowH": {
          "$density": {
            "print": 0.36,
            "presentation": 0.44
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "metric",
        "x": 7.05,
        "y": 1.55,
        "w": 2.45,
        "h": 1.05,
        "value": {
          "$slot": "impactValue"
        },
        "caption": {
          "$slot": "impactLabel"
        },
        "valueSize": 18
      },
      {
        "type": "metric",
        "x": 7.05,
        "y": 2.75,
        "w": 2.45,
        "h": 1.05,
        "value": {
          "$slot": "riskValue"
        },
        "caption": {
          "$slot": "riskLabel"
        },
        "valueSize": 18
      },
      {
        "type": "so_what",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 3.95,
        "w": 9.0,
        "h": 0.8,
        "label": {
          "$t": "common.recommended"
        },
        "text": {
          "$slot": "recommendation"
        },
        "size": {
          "$density": {
            "print": 9,
            "presentation": 10
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "source_note",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 4.85,
        "w": 9.0,
        "source": {
          "$slot": "source"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
